        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "•Acquisitions and corporate development opportunities: We may opportunistically pursue selective acquisitions and other corporate development opportunities to complement our existing platform capabilities and further accelerate our growth and platform adoption.",
